# Environment variables. Local dev/preview config (Supabase URL and
# publishable key) is injected via the platform's own environment/secret
# manager — e.g. reconnect Supabase from the "Lovable Cloud" panel in the
# editor — never by committing a .env file, even with public-safe values.
